        "b": 732.40184
      },
      "content": "Thread the locknut (136) onto the shaft (122) and tighten it until it is snug."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1617",
      "reading_order": 1872,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99996,
        "t": 729.84546,
        "r": 405.2499600000001,
        "b": 718.60546
      },
      "content": "Bend the tangs of the lockwasher into the slots of  the locknut."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1618",
      "reading_order": 1873,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99626,
        "t": 611.87394,
        "r": 386.44626000000005,
        "b": 600.6339399999999
      },
      "content": "Install the bearing housing as follows (see the illustration):"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1619",
      "reading_order": 1874,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99629,
        "t": 596.8799799999999,
        "r": 398.7262900000001,
        "b": 585.63998
      },
      "content": "Coat the outside of  the outboard bearing (112A) with oil."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1620",
      "reading_order": 1875,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99629,
        "t": 583.383,
        "r": 376.73629000000005,
        "b": 572.143
      },
      "content": "Coat the bore of the bearing housing (134) with oil."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1621",
      "reading_order": 1876,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99633,
        "t": 569.8860199999999,
        "r": 349.93632999999994,
        "b": 544.1260199999999
      },
      "content": "Put the bearing housing (134) onto the shaft. Do not use force."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1622",
      "reading_order": 1877,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00359,
        "t": 431.72521,
        "r": 444.88359000000014,
        "b": 405.96522
      },
      "content": "Fasten the gasket (360C) and the end cover (109A) with the bolts (371C). See the specified torque values."
    },
