        "r": 385.8123300000001,
        "b": 224.81076999999993
      },
      "content": "Install the inboard bearing as follows (see the illustration):"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1625",
      "reading_order": 1883,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00234,
        "t": 221.05680999999993,
        "r": 385.2823400000001,
        "b": 209.81680999999992
      },
      "content": "Coat the inner surfaces of  the bearings with lubricant."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1626",
      "reading_order": 1884,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00232,
        "t": 207.55979999999988,
        "r": 549.1423300000004,
        "b": 181.79977999999983
      },
      "content": "Put the inboard bearing (168) onto the shaft (122). The regreasable bearing has a single shield. Make sure that the bearing is installed with the shield"
    },
